0..54 Comment "/// This source gives the circle shape and two models."
55..58 Comment "///"
59..134 Comment "/// The presented-integer model proves its cancellation laws by conversion."
135..208 Comment "/// The native-integer model declares its arithmetic laws as obligations."
209..289 Comment "/// Conversion leaves arithmetic to the runtime, so the model owes each law, and"
290..334 Comment "/// a fold into the model rests on the laws."
335..338 Comment "///"
339..393 Comment "/// The winding fold maps loop words into both models."
394..464 Comment "/// Each model supplies the circle operations at its selected carrier."
465..468 Comment "///"
469..520 Comment "/// - see: corpus/model/identity/loop-winding.gandr"
522..548 Comment "// The presented integers."
